# A static field of a class that nobody reads as an object is a variable of the module: one load, one addition, one store. The class is not loaded.
# The number is an integer: a step of one is lost to rounding at 2 ** 53, so it never leaves the integers. Below 2 ** 31 the addition is a plain one.
# CHECK-LABEL: name="next" role=Source
# CHECK-NEXT: BB#0:
# CHECK: Int64 b@[[issued]] = Load(b@{{*}}ControlDependent|Reads:ModuleVariables{{*}}:GetModuleVariable)
# CHECK: Int64 b@[[next]] = Add(b@[[issued]],
# CHECK: Store(b@[[next]], b@{{*}}ControlDependent|Writes:ModuleVariables{{*}}:PutModuleVariable)
# CHECK-NEXT: Return(b@[[issued]], Terminal)
# CHECK-LABEL: end of function
# NONE-LABEL: name="next" role=Source
# NONE-NOT: Reads:ObjectFields
# NONE-LABEL: end of function
# X64-LABEL: name="next" role=Source
# X64-NEXT: instructions: 5, patchpoints: 0, rare instructions: 5
# ARM64-LABEL: name="next" role=Source
# ARM64-NEXT: instructions: {{*}}, patchpoints: 0, rare instructions: {{*}}
